  TJJM gym-website overrides, file 6. Same format as files 1-3: ~Name|URL~
  An EMPTY value blanks the link. Only add an entry that CHANGES something -
  restating a stored value pins it as a second source of truth.

  Rendered after file 5 by BOTH sections/tjjm-state-directory.liquid and
  sections/tjjm-gym-directory.liquid, so later files win on precedence. In practice
  that never matters: gate C3 forbids a gym name from appearing in more than one
  override file, because a duplicate would let a record silently fall back to a
  stale value. Blank an existing row where it already lives; do not shadow it here.

  WHY FILES 4, 5 AND 6 EXIST. The Admin API refuses a single-file rewrite above about
  24,576 bytes. Files 1, 2 and 3 all reached that limit on 15 Aug 2026. Three empty
  files were created and wired into both sections in one change so that no future
  batch ever has to rewrite a section again - fill file 4, then 5, then 6.
